{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3kBZxZmike5O-f3ueCLyRg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.124226+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/3kBZxZmike5O-f3ueCLyRg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/xL6iaTJib8nxxA3DibczCIwo3mIPwEr767ibF0BYvmA4aGHJiaP5icCial6NFsm6GS4vW3k7gDaECA8T6lOWFTHNBdNTw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>活动通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>河南医药大学位于广袤的牧野大地新乡市，北依巍巍太行，南濒滔滔黄河，是目前河南省唯一独立建制的西医本科院校。河南医药大学第五临床学院（新乡市第一人民医院）是一所集医疗、教学、科研、预防、康复、健康管理为一体的公立三甲综合医院，占地面积共45800平方米，建筑面积共102000平方米，开放床位1316张，设临床、医技科室73个，现有职工1960名，其中硕士研究生199人，研究生导师31人，高级职称232人，中级职称729人，享受国务院特殊津贴专家及高层次人才6人,河南省优秀医师4人，新乡市拔尖人才12人，新乡市十大名医6名。目前我院国家级、省级学术团体常委32人，市级学术团体会长、主委21人，副主委18人，推荐市级以上学术团体委员66人。我院拥有一支由国务院政府特殊津贴享受者、河南省省管优秀专家、省医学重点学科带头人等高层次人才组成的硕士生导师队伍。</span></p><p><span>为了让优秀大学生更好地了解河南医药大学第五临床学院（新乡市第一人民医院），我院将于</span><strong><span>2025年7月24日-25日</span></strong><span>举办优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。本次夏令营拟招收</span><strong><span>30人。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请对象条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.2025年</span><span><strong><span>应届临床医学专业</span></strong></span><strong><span>本科毕业生</span></strong><span>(包括儿科、医学影像、麻醉等五年制医学专业); </span></p><p><span>2.具有良好的品德，身体健康，遵守法律、法规和学校的规章制度，在学期间</span><strong><span>无违法违纪行为;</span></strong></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优秀，本科所有成绩</span><strong><span>无重修或补考情况</span></strong><span>，英语水平优良，具备运用</span><strong><span>英语</span></strong><span>进行科研、写作以及交流的能力。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>7月15日-20日</span></strong><span>为申请报名阶段，采用</span><strong><span>线上形</span></strong><span><span>式</span>进行报名。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.个人简历;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2.学生证和身份证复印件;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3.英语相关考试成绩证明;</span></strong></p><p><span>4.其他证明材料(如体现个人学习能力、科研情况、专业成绩排名、学术论文或其他原创性工作成果复印件、获奖证书复印件等)。</span></p><p><span>以上材料按顺序整理后合并成为一个</span><strong><span>PDF版文档，</span></strong><span>以</span><strong><span>“姓名+电话+学校”</span></strong><span>格式命名发送至</span><strong><span>x</span></strong><strong><span>xsyykjk@126.com</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。如果个人提交的个人信息不真实或不准确，医院将取消申请人选拔资格，并由申请人承担全部责任。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>三、夏令营日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营活动采用线上形式开展，以腾讯会议为活动平台。申请参加的同学请准备好笔记本电脑(确保摄像头+麦克风正常使用)，并提前安装、注册腾讯会议，熟悉腾讯会议室的使用方法，同时确保网络畅通、稳定。腾讯会议ID另行通知。具体活动内容如下:</span></p><p><span>1.开营仪式</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.医院领导介绍</span><strong><span>研究生招生和培养情况</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>各学科负责人</span></strong><span>介绍研究方向</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.</span><strong><span>知名教师</span></strong><span>讲授科研经验</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5.</span><strong><span>研究生导师</span></strong><span>与营员交流。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>以梦为马，不负韶华，期待相遇，医路向前。欢迎优秀的你参加河南医药大学第五临床学院(新乡市第一人民医院)2025年夏令营活动，我们在这里期待与你相遇!</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span><span>编辑：卫珍珍</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>责编：侯慧莹</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>图片来源：科教科</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>投稿邮箱：syyxck2020@163.com</span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xL6iaTJib8nxyNx3cAVhcQ80JcwQibsFkPkuK5nmZnZkn4ibWIKWbTlXU9o3FEXHlsibGYO6rhnHNAfYdoQvqkTQTkQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section><p><span><span><span>声明：若有图文来源标注错误或侵犯了您的合法权益，请及时与我们联系，我们将及时更正、删除。在此特别鸣谢！</span></span></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"10ccb8e011fc6ffb466ca89131ba60669b0d6a569b223e813f9f4bd4ee7778f4","textLength":1229,"sourceSha256":"19f6ff74da8a2ef8ed7849c2ad08209d84ce955b6b15279948ea60b372db191d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-aff37983d01863178552","title":"2025年河南医药大学第五临床学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.124226+00:00"}
